BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (  In ancient times, two villages stood on opposite sides of a sacred mountain. Between them lay ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    the Fountain of Echoes, blessed by the gods with a mysterious power: any offering poured int) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    o its waters would triple before reaching the other side.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  The first village suffered from drought. Their elder, though possessing little, poured one pre) Tj ET
