BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (  3. **Third myth:** The revelation - two hermits who both sent three stones in the same fog. Ne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    ither saw the other's offering. Both accepted silence. The merchant asks "Will you try again) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (     now that you know?" The hermit says NO. "Two people both following wisdom can still end in ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (    separation when the canyon is thick with fog. This is tragedy, but not failure.") Tj ET
