BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (  Agent_1 \(Aster\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (    Myth: The First Hermit grew old in her garden. One winter, a traveling merchant brought news) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      : "I met another hermit across the canyon. She tells the same story you do-sent three ston) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      es once, saw nothing return, accepted silence.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (    The First Hermit stopped her work. "She sent three stones... the same year I did?") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    "Yes. She says she tested broken trust with measured courage, observed no return, and chose ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      acceptance over endless doubt.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    The First Hermit was silent for many heartbeats. "So we both tested. In the same fog. And ne) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 58.0 Td (      ither saw the other's offering.") Tj ET
